# 4. AuthenticationManager

For login:

```http
POST /auth/login
```

with:

```json
{
  "username": "dharmendra",
  "password": "..."
}
```

The controller passes the credentials to:

```java
AuthenticationManager
```

Flow:

```text
AuthController
     |
     v
AuthenticationManager
     |
     v
DaoAuthenticationProvider
     |
     v
UserDetailsService
     |
     v
MongoDB
```

Spring Security then verifies:

```text
Username exists?
        +
Password matches?
        |
        v
Authentication successful
```

We observed this in the logs:

```text
DaoAuthenticationProvider : Authenticated user
```

This confirmed that **username/password authentication was working**.

